{"_id":"GearSpacefarer01","name":"Gear For A Spacefarer","pages":[{"_id":"GearSpacePage001","name":"Gear For A Spacefarer","type":"text","title":{"show":false,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h1>Gear For A Spacefarer</h1><p>The Cadwal Trade Depot is a fleet of merchant ships that travel across the stars avoiding local tax laws by never selling their wares while docked. The ships are large enough to act as ports with smaller ships coming and going at every hour. The ships stay in orbit for one to two weeks before leaving for another system to sell their wares elsewhere.</p><p>The CTD Lucille is a C Class Port, with a mostly android staff. You can find anything for purchase here listed in the core rules as well as what is found inside this pamphlet. Weaponry can only be legally purchased if you can provide proof you work for a private military company.</p>"},"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":-1},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1685936572185,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}},{"_id":"GearSpacePage002","name":"Entry Requirements","type":"text","title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<p>In order to enter any trade depot ships one must declare that no dangerous materials such as but not limited to:</p><ul><li>Animals Known to be Carrying Pathogens</li><li>Artificial Gravity Disruptors</li><li>Corrosive Liquids</li><li>Explosives</li><li>Flammable Liquids</li><li>Individuals with an Officially Recognized Corporate Bounty out for Their Arrest</li><li>Non PMC Sanctioned Weapons</li><li>Plants Known to be Carrying Pathogens</li><li>Super Magnets</li><li>Xenobiological Substances</li></ul><p>The presence of these objects upon docking can lead to refusal of service and or confiscation of all offending goods.</p>"},"sort":100000,"ownership":{"default":-1},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1685936572185,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1685936572185,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
